[node name="WBLavaWave" type="Node3D"]
script = ExtResource("0")
metadata/_note = "World metres. Root position = boss feet. Drive: set rise (0..1 over the 10 s wind-up) on Wall/Crest/Skirt materials (duplicate them), then tween root scale x/z outward (start 1 = 80 m radius via the children). Wall height 24 m; keep Crest.position.y and CrestSpray.position.y = 24*rise (+3 for spray) so the crest rides the wall top. Spray particles follow the crest (local coords). v3.2: follow_ground raycasts 4x64 ground heights around the ring (ground_mask) and drapes wall/crest/skirt/posts/spray on the terrain."

